diff --git a/features/todo-filtering.feature b/features/todo-filtering.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..f691f9f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/todo-filtering.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,67 @@
+Feature: Todo Filtering
+  As a user
+  I want to filter the todo list by completion status
+  So that I can focus on what is active or already completed
+
+  Background:
+    Given the TodoMVC app is loaded
+    And the todo list has items "Buy milk", "Walk dog", "Write code"
+    And "Walk dog" is completed
+
+  Rule: Default route shows all todos
+
+  Scenario: Show all todos by default
+    When the app loads with the default route
+    Then the todo list shows 3 items
+    And the "All" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Rule: Active filter
+
+  Scenario: Show only active todos
+    When the user clicks the "Active" filter link
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+    And the "Active" filter link has the selected class
+    And the "All" filter link does not have the selected class
+
+  Rule: Completed filter
+
+  Scenario: Show only completed todos
+    When the user clicks the "Completed" filter link
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the "Completed" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Rule: Routing
+
+  Scenario: Navigate via #/active URL
+    When the URL hash is set to "#/active"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+    And the "Active" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Scenario: Navigate via #/completed URL
+    When the URL hash is set to "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the "Completed" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Scenario: Navigate via #/ URL
+    When the URL hash is set to "#/"
+    Then the todo list shows 3 items
+    And the "All" filter link has the selected class
+
+  Rule: Filter reactivity
+
+  Scenario: Completing a todo hides it in active filter
+    Given the active filter is selected
+    When the user completes "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+
+  Scenario: Uncompleting a todo shows it in active filter
+    Given the active filter is selected
+    And "Buy milk" is completed
+    When the user uncompletes "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+
+  Scenario: Completing active todo shows it in completed filter
+    Given the completed filter is selected
+    And "Buy milk" is not completed
+    When the user completes "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/features/todo-management.feature b/features/todo-management.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..02128f0
